<longTitle>
<docTitle class="centered fontsize12" style="-uslm-lc:I658005">An Act</docTitle>
<officialTitle class="indentUp0 firstIndent1 fontsize8" style="-uslm-lc:I658011">To reauthorize the National Flood Insurance Program.<sidenote><p class="centered fontsize8" id="x2afd7eb4-e827-11f0-a1e4-69761a48a15a" style="-uslm-lc:I658076"><approvedDate date="2019-05-31">May 31, 2019</approvedDate></p><p class="centered fontsize8" id="x2afd7eb5-e827-11f0-a1e4-69761a48a15a" style="-uslm-lc:I658076">[<ref href="/us/bill/116/s/1693">S. 1693</ref>]<?GPOvSpace 08?></p></sidenote></officialTitle>
</longTitle>
<enactingFormula style="-uslm-lc:I658120"><i>  Be it enacted by the Senate and House of Representa­tives of the United States of America in Congress assembled,</i></enactingFormula><sidenote><p class="leftAlign firstIndent0 fontsize8" id="x2afd7eb6-e827-11f0-a1e4-69761a48a15a" style="-uslm-lc:I658180">National Flood Insurance Program Extension Act</p><p class="leftAlign firstIndent0 fontsize8" id="x2afd7eb7-e827-11f0-a1e4-69761a48a15a" style="-uslm-lc:I658180">of 2019.</p><p class="leftAlign firstIndent0 fontsize8" id="x2afd7eb8-e827-11f0-a1e4-69761a48a15a" style="-uslm-lc:I658180"><ref href="/us/usc/t42/s4001">42 USC 4001 note</ref>.</p></sidenote>
<section id="d110298e94" identifier="/us/pl/116/19/s1" style="-uslm-lc:I658146"><num class="bold" value="1">SECTION 1. </num><heading>SHORT TITLE.</heading><content style="-uslm-lc:I658120">  This Act may be cited as the “<shortTitle role="act">National Flood Insurance Program Extension Act of 2019</shortTitle>”.</content></section>
<section id="d110298e104" identifier="/us/pl/116/19/s2" style="-uslm-lc:I658141"><num class="fontsize12" value="2">SEC. 2. </num><heading>REAUTHORIZATION OF NATIONAL FLOOD INSURANCE PROGRAM.</heading><subsection class="firstIndent0 fontsize10" id="y2afda5c9-e827-11f0-a1e4-69761a48a15a" identifier="/us/pl/116/19/s2/a" role="instruction" style="-uslm-lc:I658120"><num class="fontsize10" style="-uslm-lc:emspace2" value="a">(a) </num><heading class="fontsize10"><inline class="smallCaps">Financing</inline>.—</heading><content>Section 1309(a) of the National Flood Insurance Act of 1968 (<ref href="/us/usc/t42/s4016/a">42 U.S.C. 4016(a)</ref>) <amendingAction type="amend">is amended</amendingAction> by <amendingAction type="delete">striking</amendingAction> “<quotedText>May 31, 2019</quotedText>” and <amendingAction type="insert">inserting</amendingAction> “<quotedText>June 14, 2019</quotedText>”.</content></subsection>
<subsection class="firstIndent0 fontsize10" id="y2afda5ca-e827-11f0-a1e4-69761a48a15a" identifier="/us/pl/116/19/s2/b" role="instruction" style="-uslm-lc:I658120"><num class="fontsize10" style="-uslm-lc:emspace2" value="b">(b) </num><heading class="fontsize10"><inline class="smallCaps">Program Expiration</inline>.—</heading><content>Section 1319 of the National Flood Insurance Act of 1968 (<ref href="/us/usc/t42/s4026">42 U.S.C. 4026</ref>) <amendingAction type="amend">is amended</amendingAction> by <amendingAction type="delete">striking</amendingAction> “<quotedText>May 31, 2019</quotedText>” and <amendingAction type="insert">inserting</amendingAction> “<quotedText>June 14, 2019</quotedText>”.</content></subsection>
<subsection class="firstIndent0 fontsize10" id="y2afda5cb-e827-11f0-a1e4-69761a48a15a" identifier="/us/pl/116/19/s2/c" style="-uslm-lc:I658120"><num class="fontsize10" style="-uslm-lc:emspace2" value="c">(c) </num><sidenote><p class="leftAlign firstIndent0 fontsize8" id="x2afda5cc-e827-11f0-a1e4-69761a48a15a" style="-uslm-lc:I658180"><ref href="/us/usc/t42/s4016">42 USC 4016 note</ref>.</p></sidenote><heading class="fontsize10"><inline class="smallCaps">Retroactive Effective Date</inline>.—</heading><content>If this Act is enacted after May 31, 2019, the amendments made by subsections (a) and (b) shall take effect as if enacted on May 31, 2019.</content></subsection>
</section>
<action>
<actionDescription style="-uslm-lc:I658030">Approved</actionDescription> <date date="2019-05-31">May 31, 2019</date>.</action>
